        "collapsible_row_QyC6fG": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is your return policy?",
            "sub-heading": "",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p></p><p>We want you to love your purchase 🤍 If something isn’t quite right, please email us at <a><strong>contact@thelittlepioneers.com.au</strong></a> within <strong>30 days of receiving your order</strong>, including your order number and a brief description.</p><p><strong>Change of mind returns</strong> are accepted if items are unused, in original packaging, and in resellable condition. Return shipping is at your cost, and original shipping fees are non-refundable.</p><p>Due to hygiene reasons, we cannot accept returns on items that have been used for meals.</p><p><strong>Please note:</strong></p><ul><li>Only unused items from bundles can be refunded</li><li>Free gifts must be returned or their value will be deducted</li><li>Seconds stock and used feeding items are not eligible for return<br/></li></ul><p>If your item is <strong>faulty, damaged, or incorrect</strong>, please contact us with photos and we’ll organise a replacement or refund.</p><p>For full details, please refer to our <a href=\"/pages/shipping-returns\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Shipping & Returns\"><strong>Shipping & Returns Policy</strong></a>.</p><p>📩 Need help? Contact us anytime at <a><strong>contact@thelittlepioneers.com.au</strong></a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Ec4Yyc": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How can I contact support?",
            "sub-heading": "",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Reach us via email contact@thelittlepioneers.com.au or our <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact\">Contact us page.</a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_TQBaD6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What’s your warranty policy?",
            "sub-heading": "",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>We offer a <strong>2-year manufacturing warranty </strong>on all Little Pioneers products. This covers any manufacturing defects in materials or workmanship.Please note, the warranty does not cover:</p><ul><li>Normal wear and tear</li><li>Damage caused by misuse or incorrect assembly</li><li>Modifications or use not intended by the instructions</li><li>Improper cleaning or storage</li></ul><p>If you experience a problem, just get in touch with us — we’ll make it right wherever we can!<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
